          "text": "$19$",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "text": "$27$",
          "why": "Evaluated $Q(1)=5$ instead of $Q(-1)$: $22+5$."
        },
        {
          "text": "$25$",
          "why": "Subtracted $Q(-1)$ instead of adding it: $22-(-3)$."
        },
        {
          "text": "$-1$",
          "why": "Did not square $5$ in $P(5)$: $(5-3)+(-3)$."
        }
      ],
      "solution_text": "$P(5)+Q(-1)$\n$P(5)=(5)^{2}-3=22$\n$Q(-1)=4(-1)+1=-3$\n$P(5)+Q(-1)=22+(-3)$\n$=19$"
